Z||000006||ChopTop||03-22-2001||10:47 PM||||Thanks folks, and Twist for taking the time to post the pics for me.  As you can see the car needs to be painted.  I had the top chopped by Archie over two years ago, and haven't done much of anything with it since then, other than putting a 88 rear bumper cover on it because I want the smooth moldings.  I have managed to accumulate the rest of the ground effects. I can't make my mind up on color, I go from silver, to red, to white, to black.  Right now I'm leaning towards bright white again.  The car definitely needs lots of detail work and it will never be a show car, just a nice driver I hope.  It is fun, and it gets lots of "What-The-Hell-Is-That" looks.  BTW, I am 6ft, and it takes a little bending to get in and out, having the sunroof helps a little.  If I ever paint it I'll post pics, thanks for the comps, appreciate them.||||reg||1
