Z||000011||ChopTop||03-23-2001||05:56 PM||||The windows do seal, but not as well as stock windows.  Also, since they are plexiglass the dew wipes have already started to leave trail marks.  I know they were tricky to engineer, let alone fit perfectly.  <BR>WKD, I think you're getting my choptop mixed up with the Purple Pavement Eater, that one has the fastback GT taillight treatment, mine has the stock notchback taillights.<BR>Darklord, sure you'd fit, course you might have to remove the seats...||||reg||1
